flowchart TD
    A[LSP Signature Rules] --> B[Method Argument Rule]
    A --> C[Return Type Rule]
    A --> D[Exception Rule]

    B --> B1[Parent.print(string)]
    B --> B2[Child.print(string) override]
    B2 --> B3[Signature compatible]
    B3 --> B4[LSP Followed]

    C --> C1[Parent.getAnimal() -> Animal*]
    C --> C2[Child.getAnimal() compatible return]
    C2 --> C3[Covariant/compatible behavior]
    C3 --> C4[LSP Followed]

    D --> D1[Parent throws logic_error]
    D --> D2[Child throws out_of_range]
    D2 --> D3[Narrower/expected exception]
    D3 --> D4[Design-wise LSP Followed]
    D --> D5[Broader extra exception]
    D5 --> D6[May break client expectation]

    B4:::good
    C4:::good
    D4:::good
    D6:::bad

